subsequently maintained by the Ghost Foundation. Substantial portions of the
source remain the work of those projects' contributors and are used under the
terms above; the v9 rewrite is the work of Team AppThreat. The terms of this
licence are unchanged from the original.

The SQLite amalgamation vendored under deps/sqlite-amalgamation-* is public
domain. Its authors have dedicated it to the public domain, and it carries no
licence conditions of its own:

    The author disclaims copyright to this source code. In place of a legal
    notice, here is a blessing: May you do good and not evil. May you find
    forgiveness for yourself and forgive others. May you share freely, never
    taking more than you give.

Builds that link an external SQLite or SQLCipher instead of the vendored
amalgamation take their terms from that library; SQLCipher is distributed by
Zetetic LLC under its own BSD-style licence.
